{"ticker":"WAT","updated":"2026-11-14T01:33:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Waters Corporation","shortName":"Waters Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.waters.com","fullTimeEmployees":15000,"marketCap":90454654976,"trailingPE":192.57321,"forwardPE":27.847157,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":16.123003,"pegRatio":1.85,"targetMeanPrice":503.28912,"targetHighPrice":550.0,"targetLowPrice":387.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":1.209,"earningsGrowth":-0.67,"grossMargins":0.55442,"operatingMargins":0.15985,"profitMargins":0.01758,"totalRevenue":5610286080,"beta":1.148,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":483.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":282.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Waters Corporation provides analytical workflow solutions in Asia, the Americas, and Europe. The company operates through two segments, Waters and TA. The company designs, manufactures, sells, and services liquid chromatography, as well as mass spectrometry (MS) technology systems and supports products, including chromatography columns, and other consumable products. It also designs, manufactures, sells, and services thermal analysis, rheometry, and calorimetry instruments for use in predicting the suitability and stability of fine chemicals, pharmaceuticals, water, polymers, metals, and viscous liquids for various industrial, consumer goods, and healthcare products, as well as for life science research; and develops and supplies software-based products that interface with its instruments, as well as other manufacturers' instruments. In addition, the company offers MS technology, which is used in drug discovery and development comprising clinical trial testing, the analysis of proteins in disease processes, nutritional safety analysis, and environmental testing. Its products are used by clinical, pharmaceutical, biochemical, industrial, nutritional safety, environmental, academic, and governmental customers working in research and development, quality assurance, and other laboratory applications. The company was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Milford, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"沃特世公司在亞洲、美洲和歐洲提供分析工作流程解決方案。該公司透過兩個部門運作：Waters 部門和 TA 部門。該公司設計、製造、銷售和服務液相層析以及質譜 (MS) 技術系統和支援產品，包括色譜柱和其他消耗品。它還設計、製造、銷售熱分析、流變測定和量熱儀器並提供服務，用於預測各種工業、消費品和醫療保健產品以及生命科學研究的精細化學品、藥品、水、聚合物、金屬和粘性液體的適用性和穩定性；並開發和提供與其儀器以及其他製造商的儀器連接的基於軟體的產品。此外，該公司還提供 MS 技術，用於藥物發現和開發，包括臨床試驗測試、疾病過程中的蛋白質分析、營養安全分析和環境測試。其產品被臨床、製藥、生化、工業、營養安全、環境、學術和政府客戶用於研發、品質保證和其他實驗室應用。該公司成立於 1958 年，總部位於馬薩諸塞州米爾福德。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":297.5,"h":299.69,"l":295.2,"c":299.04,"v":539700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":299.24,"h":304.34,"l":296.61,"c":303.08,"v":515100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":303.68,"h":311.44,"l":300.93,"c":303.68,"v":1052800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":305.4,"h":309.57,"l":302.47,"c":306.38,"v":792700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":307.93,"h":307.93,"l":300.62,"c":300.87,"v":2012700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":299.75,"h":302.77,"l":295.11,"c":302.48,"v":746500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":301.45,"h":305.39,"l":299.02,"c":299.22,"v":474400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":297.38,"h":299.66,"l":290.77,"c":292.65,"v":702400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":290.23,"h":290.23,"l":285.68,"c":287.79,"v":470900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":288.46,"h":292.04,"l":284.52,"c":291.71,"v":396800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":292.44,"h":292.44,"l":286.59,"c":289.43,"v":626300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":289.6,"h":300.47,"l":287.66,"c":299.81,"v":848700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":300.66,"h":322.81,"l":299.63,"c":319.81,"v":1209600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":318.68,"h":327.86,"l":318.13,"c":321.92,"v":616700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":323.95,"h":333.4,"l":322.83,"c":328.39,"v":731900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":327.5,"h":330.0,"l":325.54,"c":327.62,"v":433000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":328.35,"h":331.28,"l":318.14,"c":318.35,"v":491200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":321.16,"h":330.48,"l":319.6,"c":327.65,"v":603900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":3